WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.760
In fictional practice, Apple states: soap and water, immediate reporting and medical evaluation. Do not wait for symptoms.

2
00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:17.460
Apple shows the dummy box position and fill line to the trainer. Hand hygiene and PPE follow the reviewed local checklist.

3
00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:27.840
Apple nearly slips on the simulated walkway. No injury or exposure occurs. She reports time, place, hazard and actual control.

4
00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:37.780
Confirm the reporting contact and route to qualified evaluation. Forms must not delay care. A provider decides treatment.

5
00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:47.560
Rotate three roles, give feedback and retry safely. Unobserved is not passed; solo rehearsal does not replace observation.

6
00:00:47.860 --> 00:01:00.300
In simulation, the trainer sees Apple’s safe dummy demonstration and immediate reporting and evaluation pathway. Documentation follows care; no medical outcome is promised.
